From: CosmosEx Buildroot <4372835+planeturban@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 19:59:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ce_main_app: hard disk images: USB drives, download, rename,
 delete

The hddimage section also lists image files (.img .hd .hdd .ima .raw) in
the top folder of each USB drive, and says which image is attached. New
in its PUT: {"delete": path} and {"rename": {path, name}} for images in
/storage/hdd_images (with their notes; delete refuses the attached image,
rename keeps it attached). GET /api/v1/settings/hddimage/download?path=
sends a listed image as a file.
---
